Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Integrate pallet extension and enable local Docker
 deployment

- Update CD workflow to append pallet extension to production environment variables
- Add pallet path repository to composer.json for local API development
- Modify console Dockerfile to copy pallet package via additional build context
- Configure docker-compose.yml to build application locally with pallet integration
- Set EXTENSIONS=pallet in console environment files and config
- Simplify .gitignore rules for cleaner repository state
